  "description": "Boom! Welcome to Flula Makes Five, a sitcom starring Flula Borg! The Roberts family move into their new dream house unaware that a German techno DJ holds an ironclad 100-year lease to their basement— and to the bottom shelf of their refrigerator. Filmed before a live studio audience, but sadly, with the lens cap on. So now it's a podcast! Also starring John Lehr, Julie Edwards, Henri Cash, Russell Horning + Joey, Matthew & Andrew Lawrence Created by Flula Borg, Alex Hinton & Andy Wombwell Written & Directed by Andy Wombwell FlulaMakesFive.com",
